  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening conservation of sea turtle population through community participation in the Bijagos Archipelago, Guinea Bissau.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will: 1. conduct community based patrols and monitoring on 52 km of the main nesting beaches of Orango National Park; and 2. outreach and education programs will be conducted with local villagers, fisherman and school children within the Park.</narrative>
